2. Core Simulation Engines & Tech Stack
High-Performance Computing (HPC) Simulation Kernel
* Language & Architecture: Compiled C++20 / Rust deterministic physics core using SIMD vectorization and lock-free execution queues.
* Kinematics Engine: Full 6-Degrees of Freedom (6-DOF) flight dynamics for all airborne objects, accounting for mass decay during rocket motor burn, aerodynamic drag coefficients ($C_d$) across subsonic, supersonic, and hypersonic regimes, and variable thrust vectoring.
* Environmental & METOC Integration: Real-time atmospheric pressure, temperature lapse rates, winds-aloft vectors, and weather clutter affects both radar attenuation and interceptor aerothermal bounds.
Cognitive Decision Support Engine
* Automated Trajectory Calculation: Continuous forward-projection of target pathways using Extended Kalman Filters (EKF) and Unscented Kalman Filters (UKF).
* Impact Point Prediction (IPP): Calculates precise ground impact coordinates within <0.5 seconds of trajectory acquisition.
* Fire/No-Fire Cost Evaluation: Real-time economic and strategic calculation engine comparing target value against interceptor cost. Ensures high-cost interceptors (e.g., $3M+ PAC-3 MSE, $10M+ SM-3/GBI) are reserved for strategic assets, while directing low-cost targets heading toward unpopulated areas to be allowed unhindered impact or engaged by lower-tier assets (e.g., $40k-$50k Tamir interceptors).
Standards & Interoperability
* IEEE 1278 DIS: Full compliance with Distributed Interactive Simulation (DIS v7) protocols for real-time entity state, emission, and detonation PDU broadcasting.
* IEEE 1516 HLA: Complete support for High Level Architecture (HLA Evolved) Run-Time Infrastructure (RTI), enabling federated multi-domain joint military exercises with live operational C2 systems.
Graphical User Interface
* Consoles: Multi-monitor, dual-touchscreen tactical operator consoles with customizable window layouts.
* Geospatial Engine: High-performance WebAssembly/WebGL rendering engine displaying 2D tactical maps and 3D geospatial trajectories at 60 FPS under full saturation load (>10,000 active tracks).
* Interface Elements: Real-time alert banners, ROE confirmation prompts, intercept timeline overlays, and dynamic sensor coverage domes.


